[h2]Build 0.9.2[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]First build as its own mod.[/b] Adds the HR button with the Time use, Job advisor, Workload and Job titles pages.
[*]A Title column on the Work tab. Click a colonist's title to change it, or click the column header to give one title to everyone or remove all titles.
[*]Colonists can hold up to three job titles. The first is their main job; the second and third are pushed down a step each and merged in.
[*]A Colonists view on the Job titles page: drag a colonist's titles into order, see the work priorities they add up to, and filter the list by title held.
[*]Boxes you change by hand on a title holder, on the Work tab or in the Colonists view, are remembered and kept when their titles change.
[*]A job title library shared between all your games.
[*]Mod options to leave workbenches or bills out of the workload analysis.
[*]Optional badges on colonist portraits showing what each colonist is doing.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Early build for RimWorld 1.7 on Waylith. Safe to add to an existing save.
[/list]
